Z||000001||DaRkLoRD||12-22-2000||10:01 PM||||that reminds me... last saturday while going to visit my grandparents in Brampton for an early christmas dinner, I saw a SWEET 85GT in the parking lot... it was red, no wing, black roof (like BBBADGT's & 1FST2M6's) and I think polished "tech" wheels. it was very cool... I left a Fiero card under the wiper, but I'm not sure it survived. it was raining really hard that day, and by 7pm it was freezing rain.. I have no idea how well the cards withstand weather like that..<P>also, the fiero had a very cool hood vent mod that I've never seen before... it had several rectangular holes cut, with the edges smoothed over, and a grille attached underneath the hood. it looked quite professional..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
